name q-and-a
category Package
revision 69164
shortdesc Typesetting Q&A-style conversation made easier
relocated 1
longdesc Q-and-A is a LaTeX document class for you to typeset Q&A-style
longdesc conversation. It turns simple pure text Q&A dialog into a
longdesc carefully designed document. Notably, it features two themes,
longdesc ChatGPT-light and ChatGPT-dark, enabling you to format your Q&A
longdesc dialog in a way that closely resembles the interface of
longdesc ChatGPT.
depend einfart
runfiles size=13
 RELOC/tex/latex/q-and-a/Q-and-A.cls
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/Jinwen-XU/Q-and-A
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/q-and-a
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics class article-like multilingual expl3
